{"meta":{"id":"tt7967302","type":"movie","name":"El Rey de Reyes","imdb_id":"tt7967302","description":"Un padre le cuenta a su hijo la mejor historia jamás contada, y lo que comienza como un cuento antes de dormir se convierte en un viaje que cambia la vida. A través de una vívida imaginación, el niño camina junto a Jesús, presenciando sus milagros, enfrentándose a sus pruebas y comprendiendo su sacrificio final. El Rey de Reyes nos invita a redescubrir el poder perdurable de la esperanza, el amor y la redención a través de los ojos de un niño.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt7967302.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mr2LvZydvor6CDZhrpJLRYMCcBc.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rEQiMe9NwOcT64xG3iaRqvKzBZ3.png","genres":["Aventura","Animación","Familia","Fantasía"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-04-07T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"100 min","imdbRating":"6.8","country":"South Korea, United States of America","cast":["Oscar Isaac","Kenneth Branagh","Uma Thurman","Pierce Brosnan","Roman Griffin Davis","Forest Whitaker","Ben Kingsley","Mark Hamill","Ava Sanger","Jim Cummings","Dee Bradley Baker","Fred Tatasciore","James Arnold Taylor","Vanessa Marshall","Mick Wingert","Imari Williams","Frank Todaro","Millicent Miereanu","Noah Alexander"],"director":["장성호"],"writer":["장성호","Charles Dickens"],"trailers":[{"source":"YmFID4mNdVA","type":"Trailer","name":"El rey de reyes - Tráiler español","ytId":"YmFID4mNdVA","lang":"es"},{"source":"HkGZ4ykhYPg","type":"Trailer","name":"Final Trailer","ytId":"HkGZ4ykhYPg","lang":"en"},{"source":"HDhet3EVRac","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"HDhet3EVRac","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"YmFID4mNdVA","title":"El rey de reyes - Tráiler español"},{"ytId":"HkGZ4ykhYPg","title":"Final Trailer"},{"ytId":"HDhet3EVRac","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"6.8","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/tit